 decision=dict(status='EXPLICIT_CONNECTION_CONTEXT_VALIDATED_NO_PREDICTIVE_PRESSURE',totals=totals,runs=18,exact_NET_pin_sink_joins=totals['connections'],bindings=bindings,limitations=['Entry tree membership flags are copied from actual passed tree, not independently reconstructed per-connection physical ledger.','Connection query proof alone lacks pin-order proof; additional independent physical-pin export join now proves exact NET/pin/sink identities.','Linker-visible cost-call totals equal prior cohort; not proof of every same-object/inlined cost path.','No predictive pressure injection, original full9 final-occupancy quality/native/fullpaid/unseen/hardware obligations remain.'],next_action='First capture native route-tree occupancy update events (setup rip-up/prune and committed new branches), reconstruct an independent perNET CHANNEL ownership ledger, and reconcile it at connection entries and actual cost queries. Then evaluate conditional demand on actual queries against declared future labels, preserving failed width96 availability and original final-occupancy gates. Never double-subtract or multiply existing present/history costs.')
